
@startuml
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam linetype ortho
title Flyweight Pattern - Text Editor

interface Flyweight <<Flyweight>> {
    + render(value : char, highlighted : bool) : void
}

class CharacterStyle <<ConcreteFlyweight>> {
    - bold : bool
    - italic : bool
    - color : string
    --
    + render(value : char, highlighted : bool) : void
}

class StyleFactory <<FlyweightFactory>> {
    - styles : Map<StyleKey, shared_ptr<const Flyweight>>
    --
    + getStyle(bold : bool, italic : bool, color : string) : shared_ptr<const Flyweight>
}

class Character <<Context>> {
    - value : char
    - style : shared_ptr<const Flyweight>
    --
    + display(highlighted : bool) : void
}

class TextEditor <<Client>> {
    - characters : vector<Character>
    - highlightedPositions : set<size_t>
    - styleFactory : StyleFactory
    --
    + addCharacter(value : char, bold : bool, italic : bool, color : string) : void
    + highlight(position : size_t) : void
    + removeHighlight(position : size_t) : void
    + display() : void
}

Flyweight <|.. CharacterStyle

StyleFactory o-- "0..*" Flyweight : caches
StyleFactory ..> CharacterStyle : creates

Character --> Flyweight : shares

TextEditor *-- StyleFactory
TextEditor *-- "0..*" Character

note right of CharacterStyle
    Intrinsic state:
    - bold
    - italic
    - color

    Immutable after creation
end note

note right of Flyweight
    Receives extrinsic state:
    - character value
    - highlighted status
end note

note bottom of TextEditor
    Stores dynamically highlighted
    character positions.
end note

@enduml
